{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_headbr_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_headbr_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"在冬夜裡燃燒","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_headbr_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"49f32d4935c65967a0ff0b437e538263052bbb089d717c2fe25b69a965b6fbc9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拉達......也不在這裡嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（最近，她好像很忙啊。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊、隊長！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？哦，是慕斯啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上回實戰演習的時候，做得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，畢竟經過了烈夏小姐的魔鬼訓練嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？羅莎琳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，是之前新分隊名單出來的時候，我看到你是我的隊長......我記得你們關係很好，所以就去問她一般戰鬥的時候要怎麼配合你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很爽快地就答應陪我訓練了，還告訴我一個配合你戰鬥的小竅門......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼竅門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烈夏小姐說：“只要索尼婭她上了，你就跟著上就行了！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個傢伙......嘖，我說之前怎麼都找不到她人，原來是和你在訓練室啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不光是我......好多幹員都搶著去找烈夏小姐陪練呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且最近她在訓練室一待就是一整天......唉，我什麼時候才能有她那麼旺盛的精力呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪，太驚人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"那個新人，完全不像是剛剛從後勤部門轉入前線的樣子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼堅固的鋼板，被她那種特製的弩箭直接洞穿了......也太恐怖了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這還不是最恐怖的地方......你聽說了嗎？Stormeye先生頭一回在實戰演練中那樣誇獎一個新人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他們在談論的，難道是娜塔莉婭？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是她也不意外吧。奇怪，這是什麼感覺......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我不是應該為她高興嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（真麻煩......我看看，應該快到了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（裡面有聲音？好像很多人......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？是誰在敲門呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓本皇家偵探來一探究竟......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凜......凜冬小姐！你是來找真理的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真理她......正在和大家分享她對於《冬日營火》這本書的讀後感呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去叫她過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等一下，不用了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒啥特別重要的事，等晚點再來就是了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"narration","text":"五天後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅莎琳會在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......果然，並不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上費了半天勁，煎了一個肉餅，還是沒有拉達做的一半好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去找梅借到了《冬日營火》。今天晚上，應該就能看完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有那個難喝得要死的紅茶......我現在算是明白了，娜塔莉婭那個傢伙，完全是在依靠那種詭異的口感來提神的吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自治團......我們以前的生活，就應該像這樣簡單，不是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光......你都聽到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，你來的正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對現在的分隊情況有異議，我覺得真理、烈夏她們，更適合與我在一個隊伍裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙......這不是明知故問嗎？我們一直都是一個團隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的分隊方案，並不是看隊員們是否來自同一個地方、關係是否親近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你們走向戰場，這是羅德島的戰略需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"目前的方案，是我們綜合考量了實現任務目標、發揮幹員個人能力與團隊協同作用後，最負責的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼看起來永遠是這樣一副沒有煩惱的樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬，你馬上就要帶領重組的小隊，執行任務了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你要記得，你現在是一個小隊的隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......是啊，“隊長”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我的新身份嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......這裡的晚上可真冷啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，要不要來根煙，暖和暖和？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"您應該......成年了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不抽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好小心點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個季節的烏薩斯乾燥得很，星火落在乾草上一點就著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......知道了，我也不抽就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......太冷了......你們說，這回任務的陣仗是不是有點太大了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"無非是尋找一批在運送途中丟失的醫療物資，用得著這麼多人力嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我覺得既然臨光前輩安排我們來，肯定是有她戰略上的考量的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，能有啥安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不過就是幾個新手，也沒啥實戰經驗，你還指望長官派我們去執行更困難的任務嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜沒和之前一起訓練的醫療部妹妹分到一隊，我本來還想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！你們看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那邊有火光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我們過去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這是......帳篷都被燒毀了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的標誌......這是我們的臨時駐地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帳篷裡的那些密封箱，是不是那些丟失的醫療物資？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......安娜，和醫療部給的藥品圖樣對一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......隊長，真理小姐不在我們小隊裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，恕我直言，您這次出任務好像一直有點心不在焉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得您好像和真理小姐、早露小姐她們屬於同一個學生自治團吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在我們才是一個小隊的。耀騎士不是提醒過我們，在戰場上要信任自己的隊友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我大概確認了一下，帳篷裡的應該就是我們丟失的那批物資。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"絕對沒錯！這和本艦上那些待運物資的包裝完全一樣嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，走吧，大家情緒不要那麼緊張，去回收我們的勝利果實吧......沒想到這麼順利啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別......別過去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你們是誰？放開我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗魯的流寇","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"別再亂動了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗魯的流寇","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"不然下次瞄準的就不是手臂，而是你的腦袋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的流寇","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"無可奉告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的流寇","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"把藥品、裝備，還有其他值錢的東西都留下，我們就放他走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的流寇","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巡松，你自己站穩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？隊長，你別衝動啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯！我們上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收、收到！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗魯的流寇","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的流寇","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該就是他們的頭兒吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的流寇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說話！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的流寇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已經暈過去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，真不禁打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巡松，你怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......隊長，原來你記得我的名字啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，傷口不深......我可以自己簡單處理一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"只是剛才心臟都快要跳出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我大概不太適合上戰場......之後得和長官申請一下，看看能不能轉到後勤或者醫療部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"膽小鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路崎，帳篷裡的情況怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我檢查過了，那些裝物資的箱子確實是屬於羅德島的沒有錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"不過裡面都空了，藥品都不見了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，你這傢伙，醒醒，別裝了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"流寇頭子被凜冬抓著衣領晃來晃去，身上、口袋裡的物品掉落了一地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個......這個是......彼得海姆中學......學生卡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的流寇","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的流寇","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的流寇","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你是林子裡的......這裡是哪裡？你到底想幹什麼？我其他弟兄們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真麻煩，一醒來就是一連串的無聊問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們把你帶回來，給你檢查健康狀況，為你營養不良的身體補充能量，還讓你住在宿舍裡，你就算不準備表達感謝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好歹稍微放尊重一點吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹尼爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的流寇","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道我的名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的學生卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到能在那麼偏遠的破林子裡撞見校友啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不認識我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你是冬將軍？我都沒認出來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，既然你還記得我，那就簡單多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些醫療藥品，去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我賣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賣了？那錢呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......花光了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是認真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙......早知如此，當時真該讓那群貴族學生多揍你一陣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你真賣了，也要把買家、經手人以及贓款數額都一五一十地告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好搞清楚狀況，雖然羅德島暫時收留你，但若你不配合，我們也有權利把你交給烏薩斯的警方處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"真沒想到，我居然會被冬將軍以“找警察處理”的說辭威脅......看來離開了切爾諾伯格，所有人都是會變的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"冬將軍......不，索尼婭。如果還在彼得海姆中學，我估計會按你說的做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟我沒有別的選擇，要嘛跟著你，要麼就只能在那群貴族雜碎的拳腳下苦苦求饒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你也可以跟著我，就像當時你加入烏薩斯學生自治團一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是羅德島。是羅德島收留了我們，帶我們離開了切爾諾伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道能不能讓你也加入羅德島......不過我覺得只要你願意工作，應該也不是問題吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，烏薩斯學生自治團，真是令人懷念的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"如果安娜也在羅德島，那當時她怎麼不在你身邊呢？你隊裡那兩兄弟，加起來可能還沒有安娜一半聰明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。那是我的隊員，還輪不到你來評價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於安娜......她們也有她們的事情要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，她們的事。你不會真以為，自己可以當一輩子學生自治團的領袖吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"既然是羅德島收留了你，也是羅德島收留了安娜她們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼安娜她們還會像你習以為常的那樣，永遠陪在你的身邊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們當然不會永遠陪在我身邊，也最好不要那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前，我對於未來並沒有什麼打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時我想，我們都從切爾諾伯格逃出來了......未來再怎麼樣，也不會比那時候更壞吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實在的，現在羅德島對我們真的不賴。我們幾個漸漸適應了這裡的生活，也都找到了各自適合去做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於我們來說，彼得海姆已經是過去式了。烏薩斯學生自治團也一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"narration","text":"五天前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什麼？解散？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"你要解散烏薩斯學生自治團？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"我聞聞......沒有蜂蜜味......不是醉蜜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"那你在說什麼瘋話啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有說瘋話，這是我的正式決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭剛剛回來，我們不是說好一起來迎接她，慶祝她的好成績嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"解散自治團的事......就算你真的這麼想，也不應該這時候說吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，現在就是最好的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們團體建立的初衷，很重要的一條就是為了相互支撐著渡過那段昏暗混亂的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，現在我們已經走出來了。自治團的大家，都已經在羅德島上找到了自己更願意投入精力去做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像如今的娜塔莉婭，從完全不瞭解戰鬥，到在實戰演練中獲得好成績......她的變化，就是我們最好的榜樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經懷疑自己能不能成為一個稱職的領袖......或許經過這麼長時間，我獲得了大家的信任與擁戴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這不意味著我可以一直沉溺在這樣的身份之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經是烏薩斯學生自治團的領袖，而現在是羅德島一支先遣小隊的隊長......索尼婭的未來還會有更多可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，可是，古米還是不太明白呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"自治團就算解散了，對我們大家又有什麼影響呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"就算沒有烏薩斯學生自治團了，我們五個人，不還是在一起嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉達，這是不一樣的。你不是想做一個好廚師嗎？安娜也說過，她想要去大學深造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於曾經的我們來說，這些完全是做大夢。但現在我們有了更好的平台，也許......不，大家一定會有更好的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都會成為更好的自己，而不再只是一名烏薩斯學生自治團的團員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"該怎麼說呢，真不愧是我們的領袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"完全出乎我的意料......最先提出退出自治團的竟然是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是我單方面退出，是烏薩斯學生自治團解散了！大家都自由了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你思考的，關於我們未來的答案嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你應該......成年了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼安娜她們還會像你習以為常的那樣，永遠陪在你的身邊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"自治團就算解散了，對我們大家又有什麼影響呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘔——"},{"type":"narration","text":"吐出來，吐得一乾二淨。\n索尼婭，你並不是無所不能的。\n對於自治團的每一位成員來說，這會是最好的安排。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的......我本來還以為能休息一段時間呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"結果就在本艦待了沒幾天，又被派到這種地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"這回可比上次冷多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長還那樣一副志在必得的樣子......真要命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"志在必得？我看她完全是在硬撐啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你聽說了嗎......她們那個學生自治團，解散了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？她是認真的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個，又在抱怨什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，隊長！我們沒有抱怨，沒有抱怨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"饒你們一回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路崎，給我來根煙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......隊長，耀騎士特意提醒我來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我是萬萬不敢再給了，你可不要害我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，臨光那傢伙，多管閒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，隊長啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"丹尼爾就這麼把村莊的位置告訴你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼多醫療物資，都被他們藏在那個村莊裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是臨光告訴我的......真是不知道她到底對丹尼爾用了什麼手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過她一直都是那副“都交給我搞定”的樣子，我倒也不意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"可是這麼荒涼的地方......真的存在有人居住的村莊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，這該不會又是耀騎士對你的考驗吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你們看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊，是不是有個老爺爺......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，年輕人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"在這片雪原上，生面孔可不多見啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近有沒有村子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那邊的矮房子了嗎？走過那個矮房子，就能看到我們的村子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......呃，您認不認識一個叫丹尼爾的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"丹尼爾啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不好了！村長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"村子裡起火了！馬上就要燒到倉庫了！我們過冬的糧食可全在那裡啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......凜冬隊長！東面的村民們都疏散完畢了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"北面的村民疏散完畢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"西面、南面的村民也都疏散完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。慕斯，你再去和村長確認一下人數。然後幫著他們去救火吧，都是村民一磚一瓦自己蓋的房子，能保下來一間是一間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收、收到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巡松、路崎，你們跟著我。後面的工作實在是比較危險......我們得去倉庫裡，把醫療物資搶救出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？所以那些醫療物資真在這個村啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......這個等事後再和你們詳細解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......物資都在倉庫裡？隊長，這麼大的火......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，這也不是命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們不願意去，我就自己去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，這不是願不願意去的問題......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺，爺爺，哥哥會回來幫我們的吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"春天的時候，哥哥說秋天會回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等到秋天，他就真的回來了，你不記得了嗎？他還和我們一起收糧食呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"傻孩子，哥哥又沒說冬天會回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是他說，等我們下次把大列巴都吃光的時候，他就會回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但、但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......爺爺，你剛剛不是說，我們可能這個冬天都沒有麵包吃了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那哥哥一定很快就會回來了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，好孩子。聽話，奶奶還在那邊等我們呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松&路崎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"改變計劃，我先去搶救村民的糧食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可是隊長，按照現在的情況，說不定這些村民和丹尼爾是一夥的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"他們搶了我們的東西，我們還要幫他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是兩回事......你們兩個，跟我一起去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松&路崎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這回是命令。至於醫療物資的事......如果不能妥善解決，責任我來擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說，現在倉庫裡還能留下多少糧食？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"以目前的火勢，最靠近起火點的部分就別想了。不過外圍多少還能剩一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？古米不這麼認為哦~內層的也有機會呀，不過就是可能烤得有些過火候啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"訓練那麼久，可算是有表現機會了，快點快點，來大幹一場吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"總而言之，現在還來得及。我們一起上，或許還能避免一場徹底的悲劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"那時......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你！你這傢伙......你搞沒搞清楚你做了什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是不小心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"別廢話了！快點，拿水來！拿水來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不行啊，這點水根本不夠啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"火、火勢蔓延得太快了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡......那還等什麼！！快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不、不行......這是最後一個糧食點了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"別管她了，我們跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"丹尼爾留給我們一封信。他說，索尼婭可能需要其他烏薩斯學生自治團成員的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那封信以後，我們找到了臨光小姐。是她告訴了我們這個村莊的地址。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹尼爾那個傢伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，索尼婭。別再猶豫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"我們五個應該就夠了吧！不過他們兩個要怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路崎","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡松","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去搶救醫療物資！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"大家打起精神來哦！結束之後，古米要給所有人做超級好吃的平底鍋煎大列巴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭，我們一起走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安娜，你們完全可以不用來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"自治團已經解散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，但那只是你的一家之言。我是最初組建社團的提議者，難道不應該徵求我的意見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"還有拉達、羅莎琳、娜塔莉婭的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你們的意見是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都不同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概也能猜到，你到底是怎麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，關於自治團的存續，我也一直有在考慮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有遇到羅德島，我們可能現在過得也和丹尼爾沒什麼兩樣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，索尼婭......就算羅德島給了我們很多，這也不意味著我們就一定要失去什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在已經不在同一個小隊了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"來，幫我一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"這一捆可真夠重的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我提這邊吧。我們得加快點速度了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在確實不在同一個小隊了，而且未來估計也是聚少離多，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，當你想要獨自承擔什麼的時候，我們會像這樣來到你身邊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我們是永遠的夥伴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們五個人，竟然還在一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，還是面對著和那時一樣的火......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"如果沒有這場火......\n不，並沒有什麼如果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["臨光"]},{"speakerId":"char_194_rosali","aliases":["？？？","烈夏"]},{"speakerId":"char_195_glassb","aliases":["？？？","真理"]},{"speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","aliases":["？？？","古米"]},{"speakerId":"char_197_poca","aliases":["？？？","早露"]}]}
